#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "The import reads Blesta's database directly and only reads it: it copies what it needs into a private file on this server, then imports that file with the steps below. Nothing changes in Blesta. The password and system key are kept encrypted and are not shown again; leave them empty to keep the saved ones."
msgstr "Import loeb Blesta andmebaasi otse ja ainult loeb seda: see kopeerib vajaliku selle serveri privaatsesse faili ja impordib seejärel selle faili allolevate sammudega. Blestas ei muutu midagi. Parool ja süsteemivõti hoitakse krüpteerituna ja neid ei näidata enam; salvestatud väärtuste säilitamiseks jätke need tühjaks."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "The import reads ClientExec's database directly and only reads it: it copies what it needs into a private file on this server, then imports that file with the steps below. Nothing changes in ClientExec. The password is kept encrypted and is not shown again; leave it empty to keep the saved one."
msgstr "Import loeb ClientExeci andmebaasi otse ja ainult loeb seda: see kopeerib vajaliku selle serveri privaatsesse faili ja impordib seejärel selle faili allolevate sammudega. ClientExecis ei muutu midagi. Parool hoitakse krüpteerituna ja seda ei näidata enam; salvestatud parooli säilitamiseks jätke see tühjaks."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "The import reads FOSSBilling's database directly and only reads it: it copies what it needs into a private file on this server, then imports that file with the steps below. Nothing changes in FOSSBilling. The password is kept encrypted and is not shown again; leave it empty to keep the saved one."
msgstr "Import loeb FOSSBillingu andmebaasi otse ja ainult loeb seda: see kopeerib vajaliku selle serveri privaatsesse faili ja impordib seejärel selle faili allolevate sammudega. FOSSBillingus ei muutu midagi. Parool hoitakse krüpteerituna ja seda ei näidata enam; salvestatud parooli säilitamiseks jätke see tühjaks."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Import.php
